      "message": "the multiplication cannot overflow.\nthe addition can. however, FT_RAW_SIZE has to be a very big number for this to happen.\n\nWhen calculating required_size \u003d FT_RAW_SIZE + frame_pixels:\n\n```\nMax frame_pixels UINT16_MAX * UINT16_MAX \u003d 65,535 * 65,535 \u003d 4,294,836,225\n\n32-bit SIZE_MAX 2^32 - 1 \u003d 4,294,967,295\n\nMaximum safe FT_RAW_SIZE without overflow: 131,070\n```\n\nit is very difficult to create a unit test for this one. I can keep the addition with overflow API for safety",
